    "title": "\"Bundle Me Warm\" event just one week away - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Aaron Stuve ,\n5 hours ago MANKATO, Minn. (KEYC) - As fall temperatures finally settle in, the Salvation Army is preparing for its annual winter clothing giveaway. Bundle Me Warm is an annual event that allows kids to pick up winter coats, gloves, hats, boots, scarves and snowsuits free of charge from the Salvation Army’s Riverfront Drive location. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
